    "message": "fix(lifecycle): read BOM'd upgrade receipts and survive Retry-After: 0\n\nWhat was broken\n- Deferred Windows upgrades wrote their receipt via PowerShell 5.1\n  Set-Content -Encoding utf8, which prepends a UTF-8 BOM, while\n  pending_upgrade_result() read with encoding=\"utf-8\"; json.loads refuses\n  a leading U+FEFF, so the upgrade outcome was permanently unobservable\n  (probe-confirmed both ends).\n- A 429 carrying \"Retry-After: 0\" (or \"retry-after-ms: 0\") computed a\n  cooldown of 0.0 that flowed straight into extend_reactive_block, which\n  raises ValueError(\"reactive block duration must be > 0\"), so the\n  exception escaped classify_provider_failure instead of producing a\n  failure object. RATE_LIMIT_COOLDOWN_SECONDS=0 hit the same raise via\n  the no-header default path.\n\nMechanism and fix\n- Reader: parse receipts as encoding=\"utf-8-sig\", which strips legacy\n  BOMs; OSError->None degrade unchanged.\n- Writer (defense in depth): both receipt writes (timeout and final\n  result) now use [System.IO.File]::WriteAllText with\n  UTF8Encoding($false), i.e. BOM-less UTF-8, instead of Set-Content.\n- failure_policy: new _mark_rate_limited_when_positive skips the\n  reactive-block mark when the computed wait is <= 0 -- zero means\n  \"nothing to wait for\", not an error. Applied at every mark site\n  (openai.RateLimitError, openai.APIError 429, httpx.HTTPStatusError 429,\n  and the ExecutionFailure reentry branch).\n- Settings: RATE_LIMIT_COOLDOWN_SECONDS deliberately keeps its shipped\n  clamped-not-fatal contract -- LIMIT_RANGES documents a floor of 0 as a\n  real value (\"0 does not pause\") that the admin form publishes, so a\n  raising validator would contradict the range table, the form, and the\n  committed clamp tests. Zero/negative/blank resolution is now pinned by\n  name instead.\n\nVerification\n- uv run ruff format && uv run ruff check --fix && uv run ty check\n- Whole-file pytest: tests/application/test_release_updates.py,\n  tests/providers/test_failure_policy.py,\n  tests/providers/test_rate_limit_headers.py,\n  tests/config/test_limit_bounds.py -- 280 passed.\n- Mutation checks against the formatted files (each restored byte-exact):\n  * reader encoding reverted ->\n    FAILED test_pending_upgrade_result_parses_a_utf8_bom_receipt\n  * clamp neutralized (if seconds > 0 -> if True) ->\n    FAILED test_a_zero_retry_after_installs_no_reactive_block[retry-after-0-*]\n    [retry-after-ms-0-*] and ..._zero_configured_cooldown... (7 total)\n  * writer UTF8Encoding($false)->($true) ->\n    FAILED test_deferred_helper_writes_the_receipt_without_a_bom\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
